{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01QfLEQMRaKVfa8MtgMcUJFP","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've successfully retrieved all the requested files. Here's a complete report:\n\n## File Contents Report\n\n### 1. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/easy_prompt.go\n\nThis file contains functions for generating easy mode interactive prompts:\n\n- `GenerateEasyPromptFile`: Creates an easy mode prompt and persists it to `doingDir/prompts/` with skill files (TDD, sense, debug skill, grilling)\n- `GenerateEasyPrompt`: Generates easy prompt content with placeholder paths for dry-run (no file writes)\n- `GenerateEasyLearningPromptFile`: Generates a learning prompt after an easy session completes\n- `buildEasyTaskResults`: Formats a task execution table for easy mode\n- `buildCtxSection`: Renders the easy_ctx.md template for context inheritance\n- `loadDebugContextLocal`: Loads debug context from bug*.md files with frontmatter summaries or fallback to debug.md\n- `readFileOrDefault`: Utility to read files with a default fallback value\n\nThe module heavily uses a PromptBuilder pattern to populate templates with variables like loops_context, debug_content, requirement, skill paths, etc.\n\n### 2. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/easy.md\n\nThis is a comprehensive easy mode prompt template that:\n- Declares mandatory use of skill:tdd and skill:debug-skill\n- Describes the engineer role working with users interactively\n- Loads and explains core skills (TDD, debug-skill, grilling)\n- Includes project loops context and debug history\n- Contains context inheritance section (conditionally included via `{{ctx_section}}`)\n- Defines grilling (requirement clarification) process before work\n- Specifies TDD and DEBUG iron laws with 6-phase debug methodology\n- Includes learning phase triggers\n- Details work directory and interactive interaction modes\n- All critical paths reference variables like `{{tdd_skill_path}}`, `{{debug_skill_path}}`, etc.\n\n### 3. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/dream.md\n\nThis is an extensive dream phase SOP template focused on cross-job global reflection and knowledge evolution:\n\n- Defines scope: only modify `.rick/loops/` and `.rick/skills/`; forbidden to modify business code\n- Lists available project loops and pending jobs to process\n- Contains a comprehensive 10-step dream SOP process:\n  1. Initialization - confirm scope and processing list\n  2. Load behavioral trajectories from debug records, tasks.json, act-path.md, SUMMARY.md\n  3. SENSE reflection - extract optimization signals using skill:sense\n  4. Analyze debug records and cross-job common issues\n  5. Organize loops documentation\n  6. Skills evolution using skill:evolve-skills\n  7. Six-dimensional quality verification with 6 subagents (serial execution):\n     - Reference chain consistency check\n     - Invalid context cleanup\n     - Running simulation\n     - Path deduction (read-only code inspection)\n     - Source-context consistency check\n     - Dead code & refactoring RFC\n  8. Run dream_check validation\n  9. Write dream log files (`dream_run_{job_id}_log.md`)\n  10. Summary report\n- Includes strict behavior constraints on file modifications, naming conventions, mandatory declarations, and subagent execution rules\n\n### 4. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/dream_prompt.go\n\nThis file contains functions for generating dream phase prompts:\n\n- `GenerateDreamPrompt`: Generates dream prompt content with placeholder paths (for dry-run)\n- `GenerateDreamPromptFile`: Generates and saves the dream phase prompt to `.rick/dream/prompts/`, loading 4 skill files (sense, evolve-skills, source-context-consistency, refactor-rfc)\n- `formatPendingJobs`: Formats job IDs as a bulleted list\n- `loadRunLogs`: Loads all previous dream run logs from `dream_run_*_log.md` files\n- `loadActPaths`: Gathers all act-path.md files from the jobs being processed\n\nThe module uses the PromptBuilder pattern to populate the dream template with variables including pending jobs, run logs, loops context, skill paths, and act-path context."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fe33ebbd-6c4b-48e1-9176-4bc600974da7","uuid":"7a34a66e-1dfc-486d-a0d6-335b5d48c92b","timestamp":"2026-07-01T02:54:42.626Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read these files and report their full contents:\n1. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/easy_prompt.go\n2. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/easy.md\n3. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/dream.md\n\nAlso search for dream_prompt.go: first check if /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/dream_prompt.go exists, if not grep for \"dream\" in /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/ to find where dream prompt building code lives.\n\nReport full file contents for all found files.","agentId":"a878f81ce9d80bbd2","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've successfully retrieved all the requested files. Here's a complete report:\n\n## File Contents Report\n\n### 1. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/easy_prompt.go\n\nThis file contains functions for generating easy mode interactive prompts:\n\n- `GenerateEasyPromptFile`: Creates an easy mode prompt and persists it to `doingDir/prompts/` with skill files (TDD, sense, debug skill, grilling)\n- `GenerateEasyPrompt`: Generates easy prompt content with placeholder paths for dry-run (no file writes)\n- `GenerateEasyLearningPromptFile`: Generates a learning prompt after an easy session completes\n- `buildEasyTaskResults`: Formats a task execution table for easy mode\n- `buildCtxSection`: Renders the easy_ctx.md template for context inheritance\n- `loadDebugContextLocal`: Loads debug context from bug*.md files with frontmatter summaries or 